  "slug": "rice-pudding-with-dates",
  "name": "Rice Pudding With Dates",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Rice pudding sweetened by dates rather than much sugar, can be eaten warm or cold.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place the rice into a food processor or blender, and process until coarse, but not pureed. Transfer to a saucepan, and stir in the milk, sugar and dates. Cook over low heat, stirring occasionally until the dates are tender, about 20 minutes. Serve warm or cold."
    }
  ],
